        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OOq2d4FKcoUfmum5wuHjLT-d6F8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9599-Quick-Easy-Brownies-ddmfs-step-2-ebcc50d1810b4835a7a6463924781911.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9599/step_03.webp"
